WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:04.790
Margaery Tyrell: House Tyrell trace our descent
to Garth Greenhand, the legendary first King

00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:07.140
of the Reach, who made the land bloom.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:10.900
But so too does every noble house around us.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:16.390
It seems dear ancestor Garth planted as many
flowers as he plucked.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:21.110
A king should have more consideration for
his line, don't you think?

00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:26.380
For over a thousand years, the Greenhand's
sons and grandsons ruled the Reach as House

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:27.730
Gardener.

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:33.290
The offshoots of his daughters grew into vast
and powerful houses in their own right.

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:35.030
Except for House Tyrell.

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:39.870
We chose instead to serve our Gardener cousins
faithfully as stewards.

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:45.230
To manage their stronghold of Highgarden and
the daily affairs of the Reach.

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:48.770
Our words are "Growing Strong."

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:52.990
And under our stewardship, the Reach did just
that.

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:54.559
As did we.

00:00:54.559 --> 00:00:58.370
Until a blundering king almost cost us everything.

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:01.450
Aegon Targaryen had landed in Westeros.

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:06.510
King Mern allied us with the Rock to repel
the upstart's army.

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:11.690
One can only marvel that King Mern did not
reconsider when he saw the living dragons

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:14.210
against him.

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:18.830
Perhaps he should have sought counsel from
his trusted stewards before he set out.

00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:22.229
Then again, perhaps he did.

00:01:22.229 --> 00:01:30.060
At the Field of Fire, Aegon, and let us not
forget his sisters, burned the combined armies

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:31.909
of the Reach and Rock.

00:01:31.909 --> 00:01:36.810
King Mern paid for his misjudgment with his
life and that of his ancient family.

00:01:36.810 --> 00:01:44.170
In a day, the Reach had lost its king, its
ruling house, and most of its army.

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:50.190
Thankfully for everyone, my ancestor, Harlen
Tyrell, had better sense.

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:55.600
Until the maesters sorted out the entail among
Mern's cousins, Harlen, the steward was acting

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:57.700
lord of Highgarden.

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:03.090
To ensure peace and life in the Reach, he
would yield the castle of Aegon.

00:02:03.090 --> 00:02:08.840
The other castles and families would then
follow, as they had since the Dawn Age.

00:02:08.840 --> 00:02:14.900
Aegon had a continent to conquer, and the
fertile Reach was too valuable to raze.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:20.300
He accepted Harlen's proposal and welcomed
our lands into his kingdom.

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:27.170
To show his gratitude, Aegon entitled Harlen
to Highgarden, the castle his family had served

00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:33.590
for a thousand years, and made House Tyrell
his Wardens of the South, choosing us over

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:37.239
older, greater families in the Reach.

00:02:37.239 --> 00:02:41.300
Our House thus owed everything to the Targaryens.

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:47.480
So is it any wonder we stayed true to King
Aerys, even during his madness, and even after

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:50.920
Robert Baratheon rebelled.

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:55.819
Some may question my father for laying siege
to the Baratheon's home instead of marching

00:02:55.819 --> 00:03:00.800
to aid Prince Rhaegar before Robert could
kill him and scatter the royal army.

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:07.730
But let us not forget we had already dealt
Robert his only defeat of the war at Ashford.

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:14.880
If Lord Tywin Lannister had not "vanquished"
the Mad King so suddenly, our siege would've

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:19.800
destroyed Robert's home and his brothers and
won the war for Aerys.

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:26.470
But when the Targaryens fell, House Tyrell
again chose peace and prosperity over war

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:31.900
and devastation, and bent the knee to King
Robert Baratheon, First of His Name.

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:39.350
Randyll Tarly: The Andals swept across Westeros,
destroying many ancient families and kingdoms.

00:03:39.350 --> 00:03:45.150
When the invaders arrived at the Reach led
by Ser Alester Tyrell, House Gardener chose

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:51.690
accommodation over the battle, hoping honors
and marriages would sate foreigners' ambition.

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:58.290
The Tyrells were welcomed into service as
hereditary stewards of Highgarden.

00:03:58.290 --> 00:04:04.190
Thousands of years later, they repaid the
Gardeners for their acceptance.

00:04:04.190 --> 00:04:09.960
When Aegon Targaryen declared that Westeros
was now his, King Mern IX allied with King

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:12.409
Loren Lannister of the Westerlands.

00:04:12.409 --> 00:04:19.119
Together, they fought to save Westeros from
another foreign barbarian whose family practices

00:04:19.119 --> 00:04:20.689
put decent men to shame.

00:04:20.689 --> 00:04:23.740
But the dragons won.

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:30.389
The Field of Fire claimed Mern and all his
sons, grandsons, and brothers.

00:04:30.389 --> 00:04:35.569
Instead of using the castle for what it was
built to do, Harlen Tyrell surrendered it

00:04:35.569 --> 00:04:38.029
to Aegon without a fight.

00:04:38.029 --> 00:04:45.199
In exchange, Harlen was given the castle his
family had served for thousands of years with

00:04:45.199 --> 00:04:51.300
all its attendant lands and lords, including
my family.

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:56.610
Margaery Tyrell: Some Great Houses call us
upstarts, but the truth is that while the

00:04:56.610 --> 00:05:03.379
Starks and Lannisters fell to the Targaryens
in defeat, House Tyrell rose.

00:05:03.379 --> 00:05:09.300
For thousands of years, our family served
as loyal stewards to the Kings of the Reach.

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:16.050
Until the last of their line unwisely burned
to death, resisting the Targaryen invaders.

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:23.469
To save the Reach from a similar fate, we
yielded Highgarden to Aegon and his sisters.

00:05:23.469 --> 00:05:30.520
In gratitude, the Targaryens gave House Tyrell
dominion over the Reach, and we became lords

00:05:30.520 --> 00:05:35.490
of the castle in which, for generations, we
had served.

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:39.529
Under the Targaryen dynasty, Westeros prospered.

00:05:39.529 --> 00:05:44.879
Gone were the petty wars of Seven Kingdoms
and the endless thirst for minor glories that

00:05:44.879 --> 00:05:45.879
drove them.

00:05:45.879 --> 00:05:52.279
The Westerlands enriched the realm, the North
guarded it, and the Reach and Riverlands fed

00:05:52.279 --> 00:05:53.680
it.

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:59.639
This harmony is what Robert Baratheon shattered
with his rebellion against Aerys Targaryen.

00:05:59.639 --> 00:06:04.259
When the call to arms came, though, we did
not want to answer.

00:06:04.259 --> 00:06:09.999
The Reach is a gentle land, and, honestly,
the Mad King was not much loved.

00:06:09.999 --> 00:06:13.309
But we owed peace and status to his family.

00:06:13.309 --> 00:06:19.369
My father, Mace Tyrell, called his banners
and marched north to battle the rogue Storm

00:06:19.369 --> 00:06:24.449
Lord, Robert, who had already defeated three
forces in a single day.

00:06:24.449 --> 00:06:30.490
And, at Ashford, my father won.

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:34.970
Some chasten my father for not pursuing Robert
after the battle.

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:40.669
We had cut him off from the Stormlands, the
seat of his power, and he had fled north,

00:06:40.669 --> 00:06:46.469
within easy grasp of Lord Tywin Lannister,
the Hand of Aerys for twenty years.

00:06:46.469 --> 00:06:52.429
My father moved instead to lay siege of Robert's
ancestral stronghold of Storm's End.

00:06:52.429 --> 00:06:56.649
The rose would strangle the stag as the lion
pounced.

00:06:56.649 --> 00:06:57.879
So we waited.

00:06:57.879 --> 00:07:04.770
But the lion slumbered, and Robert slipped
past the King's forces to join Ned Stark.

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:09.819
We could have lifted the siege and deployed
our armies north to aid the Crown.

00:07:09.819 --> 00:07:15.399
We could have stormed the walls of the castle
and made Robert homeless.

00:07:15.399 --> 00:07:24.210
But we had ample supplies, control of land
and sea, and, most of all, patience.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:32.050
Our siege would succeed, eventually, at little
cost of life to us.

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:37.580
If Robert prolonged the war with minor victories,
our capture of Storm's End would hasten his

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:39.750
downfall.

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:45.589
And if Robert won the war, well, it would
not do for him to find us within his walls

00:07:45.589 --> 00:07:49.259
with the bodies of his brother Stannis and
his sworn men.

00:07:49.259 --> 00:07:56.330
When the lion finally showed his colors and
"purged" King's Landing, we knew our cause

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:58.449
was lost.

00:07:58.449 --> 00:08:03.469
My father chose the peaceful route and bent
the knee to Robert, who heartily pardoned

00:08:03.469 --> 00:08:05.139
us.

00:08:05.139 --> 00:08:11.650
Strange, considering how we had beaten him
and starved his brother to the brink of death.

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:19.209
We were to keep our lands, castle, and title,
But we knew we would never be welcome at court.

00:08:19.209 --> 00:08:21.210
It didn't matter.

00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:28.029
The Reach was still the most fertile of the
Seven Kingdoms and under our hand.

00:08:28.029 --> 00:08:30.999
Every flower, even the rose, needs pruning.

00:08:30.999 --> 00:08:33.009
Then it grows strong.

00:08:33.009 --> 00:08:36.370
Margaery Tyrell: The Reach is aptly named.

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:39.649
We're the ones who give your hands something
to do at the table.

00:08:39.649 --> 00:08:44.980
As the most fertile region of the Seven Kingdoms,
we grow the lion's share of the grains and

00:08:44.980 --> 00:08:52.550
fruit that feed this country, especially now
since the "rebels" have burned down the other

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:53.550
fields.

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:59.250
Yet as with all gardens, weeds grow in the
Reach too, though few name them as such.

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:03.270
Singers fill our heads with chivalry and courtly
love.

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:06.390
Fluff to make boys fight and girls swoon.

00:09:06.390 --> 00:09:10.430
Oh, the songs are good enough for a pleasure
barge down the Mander.

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:14.560
They give pleasure to the common people and
harmony to the realm.

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:21.579
But if the rise of House Tyrell proves anything,
it's that virtue and honor have their place.

00:09:21.579 --> 00:09:25.259
And if you're not careful, that place is the
grave.

00:09:25.259 --> 00:09:31.410
Unlike the Lannisters, Starks, and Arryns,
we were never kings in our own right.

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:37.000
House Gardener ruled the Reach since the Dawn
Age, and we were their stewards.

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:43.060
While they warred to enrich their already
rich domain, we managed their castle of Highgarden.

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:46.940
But then Aegon Targaryen landed with his dragons.

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:50.490
Nobody knows why the Gardener King took the
field up against him.

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:56.790
Anyone could see that a man who grows flowers
should beware a man who grows fire-breathing

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:57.790
monsters.

00:09:57.790 --> 00:10:00.759
But maybe it wasn't wholly his idea.

00:10:00.759 --> 00:10:06.029
Maybe someone whispered in his ear about all
the face he would lose with the other six

00:10:06.029 --> 00:10:08.070
kings if he stayed home.

00:10:08.070 --> 00:10:09.070
The rest is history.

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:15.209
The last Gardener King lost his face, along
with his body, and his steward Harlen Tyrell

00:10:15.209 --> 00:10:18.350
promptly yielded Highgarden to Aegon.

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:23.540
My grandmother swears that Harlen was like
most of our men and grew up banging steel

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:29.379
too loudly for thought to penetrate, but luckily
his wife had better sense.

00:10:29.379 --> 00:10:34.939
Whatever the case, in return for Harlen's
show of sense, Aegon proclaimed House Tyrell

00:10:34.939 --> 00:10:40.250
the lords of the Reach and Wardens of the
South, passing over all the other houses with

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:42.230
better claims.

00:10:42.230 --> 00:10:45.570
Yet Aegon chose us.

00:10:45.570 --> 00:10:51.889
Centuries later, when his descendant, Aerys,
faced rebellion, the Reach stayed loyal.

00:10:51.889 --> 00:10:53.100
Mostly.

00:10:53.100 --> 00:10:59.300
My father, Mace, dealt Robert his only defeat
in the war, even if it was my father's vanguard

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:02.500
who did most of the fighting before he arrived.

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:07.370
After the Battle of Ashford, we laid siege
to Storm's End, Robert's home.

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:13.199
Unfortunately, the war ended before we could
take it and free up our armies to go save

00:11:13.199 --> 00:11:13.380
the king.

